{#- WEBSITE › PAGES (mockup board "Site words by page", with Chase's notes:
   labels first, the live preview later; every language control with the
   words; everything a visitor reads translatable).

   ONE LANGUAGE AT A TIME, "Writing X beside Y": the line being written, with
   the same line in another language above it — English unless you choose
   otherwise. Not a column per language, which stops working somewhere around
   four; the site's languages are meant to grow to thirty.

   EACH LINE IS NAMED FOR WHAT IT IS ("Small line above the headline"), with
   its key kept small beside it. A heading stored as two strings for its bold
   half is ONE line here, edited as it reads, with B to mark where the bold
   begins.

   WHAT YOU SEE IS WHAT YOU DOWNLOAD. The file for a translator holds the
   lines on screen — a page, a search, Needs work, All — and More says how
   many. The languages themselves — on or off, donation page, how each is
   written, adding and removing — are one button away, in a table. -#}

<div class="c-tools">
  {#- Two rows on purpose: the languages being written, then finding and
     looking. One row wrapped wherever the window happened to cut it. -#}
  <div class="c-tools-row">
    <label class="c-pick">
      <span data-i18n="con.editing">Editing</span>
      <select id="cLang" disabled data-lang-edit></select>
    </label>
    <span class="lang-ref" id="cBesideWrap" hidden>
      <button type="button" class="lang-swap" data-lang-swap data-i18n-attr="aria-label:con.swap,title:con.swap" aria-label="Swap" title="Swap">&#8644;</button>
      <label class="c-pick">
        <span data-i18n="con.reference">Reference</span>
        <select id="cBeside" data-lang-ref></select>
      </label>
      <button type="button" class="ghost-btn sm lang-ai" data-lang-translate data-i18n="ai.translate">Translate</button>
    </span>
    <button type="button" class="ghost-btn c-tools-end" id="cLangs" disabled data-i18n="con.languages">Languages</button>
  </div>
  <div class="c-tools-row">
    <input type="search" id="cFind" autocomplete="off"
           placeholder="Find a word" aria-label="Find a word"
           data-i18n-attr="placeholder:con.find,aria-label:con.find">
    <button type="button" class="ghost-btn" id="cPrevBtn" aria-pressed="false" data-i18n="con.preview">Preview</button>
    <div class="c-more">
      <button type="button" class="ghost-btn" id="cMoreBtn" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="cMore">
        <span data-i18n="con.more">More</span><span class="console-caret" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      </button>
      <div class="c-more-menu" id="cMore">
        <button type="button" id="cDown"></button>
        <button type="button" id="cUp" data-i18n="tl.upload">Upload translation</button>
        {#- "Nothing has changed" is a claim about the copy this page loaded; the
           remedy for doubting it is to read again. -#}
        <button type="button" id="cReload" data-i18n="con.reload">Reload from GitHub</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <input type="file" id="cFile" accept=".csv,text/csv" hidden
         aria-label="Upload translation" data-i18n-attr="aria-label:tl.upload">
</div>

{#- Shown instead of the editor when GITHUB_TOKEN is absent. -#}
<p class="rolegate" id="cNotConfigured" hidden></p>

<div class="adm-content" id="cRoot" hidden>
  <nav class="c-sections" id="cSections" aria-label="Pages"></nav>
  <div class="c-panel">
    <span class="c-count" id="cCount" role="status"></span>
    <div class="c-rows" id="cRows"></div>
  </div>
  {#- THE LIVE PREVIEW (2026-10-07): the page these words are on, with what
      is typed drawn into it before it is saved (admin-content.js). -#}
  <aside class="c-preview" id="cPreview" data-device="wide" hidden>
    <div class="c-prev-bar">
      <span class="c-prev-url" id="cPrevUrl"></span>
      <span class="ws-dev" role="group" data-i18n-attr="aria-label:con.previewSize" aria-label="Preview size">
        <button type="button" data-prev-dev="wide" aria-pressed="true" data-i18n="emb.desktop">Desktop</button>
        <button type="button" data-prev-dev="phone" aria-pressed="false" data-i18n="emb.mobile">Mobile</button>
      </span>
      <a class="c-prev-open" id="cPrevOpen" href="/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-i18n-attr="title:con.previewOpen,aria-label:con.previewOpen" title="Open in a new tab">&#8599;</a>
    </div>
    <p class="hint c-prev-gone" id="cPrevGone" hidden data-i18n="con.previewGone">This page is not built on this site yet — it is showing “coming soon”. Its preview is on dev.thauma.one.</p>
    <div class="c-prev-frame"><iframe id="cPrevFrame" title="Preview" data-i18n-attr="title:con.preview"></iframe></div>
  </aside>
</div>

{#- A returned translation, line by line, in place of the editor until it is
   approved or put away. Lines the checks flag start unticked. -#}
<div class="c-review" id="tlReview" hidden>
  <div class="tl-bar">
    <span class="tl-count" id="tlReviewCount" role="status"></span>
    <button type="button" class="ghost-btn" id="tlCancel" data-i18n="common.cancel">Cancel</button>
    <button type="button" class="solid-btn" id="tlApprove"></button>
  </div>
  <div class="tl-items" id="tlItems"></div>
</div>

<div class="ms-savebar" id="cSaveBar" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden>
  <span class="ms-dirty-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <span id="cDirtyCount">0 unsaved changes</span>
  <button type="button" class="ghost-btn" id="cDiscard" data-i18n="ms.discard">Discard</button>
  <button type="button" class="solid-btn" id="cSave" data-i18n="con.save">Save</button>
</div>

{#- EVERY LANGUAGE, IN ONE PLACE (mockup board "Every language, in one
   place"): one row per language — how much is translated, on for the preview
   site, on for everyone, its donation page, how it is written, removing it —
   then adding one and the default. The console's dialog shell, so it looks
   and closes like every other dialog. Each control saves as it changes. -#}
<div class="dlg-back c-set" id="cSet" hidden>
  <div class="dlg c-set-dlg" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="cSetTitle">
    <div class="c-set-head">
      <h3 id="cSetTitle" data-i18n="con.languages">Languages</h3>
      <button type="button" class="ln-x" id="cSetClose" aria-label="Close" data-i18n-attr="aria-label:con.close">&times;</button>
    </div>
    <div class="c-set-body" id="cSetBody"></div>
  </div>
</div>
